  "question": {
    "text": "After understanding the assertion and reason, choose the correct option.<br />\r<br />\r<strong>Assertion: </strong>In the bonding molecular orbital (MO) of <math> <mrow> <msub> <mtext>H</mtext> <mn>2</mn> </msub> </mrow><mo>,</mo> </math> electron density is increased between the nuclei.<br />\r<strong>Reason:</strong> The bonding MO is <math><msub><mrow><mtext mathvariant=\"normal\">ψ</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mtext></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mrow><mtext mathvariant=\"normal\">ψ</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mtext></mrow></msub></math> , which shows destructive interference of the combining electron waves.",
